@startuml
title Figure 4.10: Sequence Diagram of the View Test Results.
actor User
participant "Vue\n(Execute / History)" as Vue
participant "Rust\n(db_commands.rs)" as Rust
database "SQLite" as DB
participant "Detail Window\n(WebviewWindow)" as Win

Rust --> Vue: event test-finished (result cards)
User -> Vue: expand failure / copy error
User -> Vue: open test file at line
Vue -> Rust: open_file(path, editor?, line)

User -> Vue: open History view
Vue -> Rust: list_execution_history(projectId)
Rust -> DB: SELECT executions
Rust --> Vue: timeline entries

User -> Vue: select an execution entry
Vue -> Rust: list_execution_result_details(executionId)
Rust -> DB: SELECT details
Rust --> Vue: per-test-case details

alt standalone window
    Vue -> Rust: get_execution_project_path(executionId)
    Vue -> Win: open ?detail=execute&id=<id>
    Win -> Rust: list_execution_result_details(executionId)
end

alt export
    Vue -> Rust: save_text_file(history.json / csv)
end
@enduml
